Service Description
Nano Banana Canvas provides a visual AI workflow platform that enables users to construct, edit, run, and share multi-step generative pipelines on an interactive canvas (collectively, the “Services”). Instead of isolated single-shot generations, the platform allows you to connect nodes for text input, AI-powered image generation, video generation, audio generation, language model calls, and display outputs into a single production chain. The Services support multiple models, including but not limited to GPT Image 2, Nano Banana, and future integrations such as Seedance and HappyHorse.

A key component of the Services is a conversational Agent that can help you draft prompts, propose workflow improvements, and explain execution issues. The Agent is designed as a proposal and explanation layer only; the canvas always retains execution control, and all final decisions remain with you.

Additionally, the Services let you save your workflows as reusable assets, explore and clone workflows published by others in the public community, and manage usage through a credit system that corresponds to the execution of AI-powered steps. Various subscription plans, one‑time packages, and credit packs are offered; current pricing is available on our Pricing page.

